  Stage Detail & Criteria

  Stage 1: Linting
   * Command: flake8 . --count --select=E9,F63,F7,F82 --show-source --statistics
   * Pass Criteria: Zero syntax errors (E9), logic errors (F63, F7), or undefined names (F82).
   * Fail Criteria: Any non-zero exit code from flake8.

  Stage 2: Unit Testing
   * Command: pytest
   * Pass Criteria: All discovered tests in the tests/ directory return Exit Code 0.
   * Fail Criteria: Any test failure or collection error (Exit Code > 0).

  Stage 3: Docker Build
   * Command: docker build -t migration-engine:${{ github.sha }} .
   * Pass Criteria: Successful creation of a local Docker image.
   * Fail Criteria: Build error (e.g., missing dependency, broken Dockerfile).

  Stage 4: Security Scan
   * Command: aquasecurity/trivy-action
   * Pass Criteria: No vulnerabilities of severity CRITICAL or HIGH found.
   * Fail Criteria: Any CRITICAL or HIGH vulnerability detected (exit-code: '1').

